setui-basic-dialekt-je-zielsystem = BASIC dialect per target system
setui-befehl-oder-kuerzel-suchen = Search for a command or shortcut
setui-bilder-laden = Load images
setui-buchstaben-und-zifferntasten-in-den-studios = Letter and digit keys in the editors (D, E, F ... for tools, Z S X ... for notes, 1–4 for character colors). Off: you no longer type anything by accident; arrows, space, Del, Esc and all shortcuts with Cmd or Alt remain, and you then choose tools with the mouse or the command palette.
setui-darstellung = Appearance
setui-das-basic-eines-projekts-folgt-dem = The BASIC of a project follows the dialect of its target system; it can be changed per source in the project file.
setui-das-debug-protokoll-schreibt-befehle-meldungen = The debug log writes commands, messages, errors and crashes to a file on your computer; nothing is sent.
setui-datei-p1 = File: { $p1 }
setui-dateien = Files
setui-debug-protokoll = Debug log
setui-der-inhalt-unbenannter-reiter-wird-alle = The content of untitled tabs is saved every few seconds in scratch.json in the configuration folder: only on this computer, never in the project, unencrypted, deleted after 14 days. Turning it off removes the backup immediately.
setui-der-konfigurationsassistent-prueft-die-einrichtung-und = The setup assistant checks your setup and changes only what you confirm.
setui-die-adresse-betrifft-nur-die-versionsliste = The address only concerns the version list (https or a folder); the link to the release page is fixed in the program. One request for the version list (update.json) is sent to github.com: GitHub sees your IP address and the program name "VintageCoder-update", without a version number. No ID, no account, no information about your computer, projects or settings.
setui-die-bilder-des-handbuchs-liegen-im = The images of the manual are on the internet and are loaded only after you agree; the choice takes effect at once and is saved.
setui-die-einstellungsdatei-enthaelt-die-passwoerter-der = The settings file contains the passwords of the hardware and is readable only by you.
setui-die-klaviertasten-des-trackers-gelten-nach = The piano keys of the tracker apply by the position of the key (as on a US QWERTY keyboard); the layout only decides which letters the hints show. Detected now: { $p1 }.
setui-die-kuerzel-sind-fest-anpassen-ist = The shortcuts are fixed; customizing is not possible yet. The list comes from the command table and also applies to the menu and the palette.
setui-editor = Editor
setui-ein-ordner-statt-einer-webadresse-wird = A folder instead of a web address is read instead of downloaded. When downloading, only the address of the image is requested; downloaded images stay in the cache.
setui-eingebaut-vc-asm = built in (vc-asm)
setui-einrichtung = Setup
setui-einstellungen = Settings
setui-einstellungen-in-eine-datei-schreiben-von = Write the settings to a file, import them from there, or reset them to the defaults.
setui-einzeltasten-der-studios = Single keys of the editors
setui-export-beim-bauen = Export when building
setui-exportieren = Export ...
setui-exportieren-schreibt-die-einstellungen-der-ide = Export writes the settings of the IDE (target systems, emulators, machines, parameters) to a JSON file, without passwords. Import first shows what is in it and then replaces the current settings; Reset restores the defaults. Color scheme and zoom are not included.
setui-fehlersuche = Troubleshooting
setui-fragen = Ask
setui-gespeichert = Saved.
setui-gilt-fuer-alle-quelltexte-und-wirkt = Applies to all source files and takes effect at once.
setui-gilt-fuer-das-bauen-in-der = Applies to building in the IDE (not to vcc on the command line). Constants from the project file come first, these after.
setui-gilt-fuer-die-ganze-oberflaeche-und = Applies to the whole interface and takes effect at once.
setui-gilt-je-projekt-und-steht-in = Applies per project and is stored in its settings.
setui-groesse-der-ganzen-oberflaeche-auch-mit = Size of the whole interface; also with Cmd + and -, back with Cmd 0.
