setui-pfade-im-persoenlichen-ordner-stehen-als = Paths in your personal folder appear as ~, passwords and tokens are blacked out. File names and error messages of your project may appear: look at it before passing it on. A new file starts at 5 MB.
setui-projekt = Project
setui-protokolldatei-schreiben = Write log file
setui-pruefe = Checking ...
setui-schreibt-zu-jedem-kuerzel-taste-umschalttasten = Writes one line to the log for every shortcut (key, modifier keys, command found, menu trigger). Local only, nothing is transmitted.
