setui-vintagecoder-kann-nachsehen-ob-es-eine = VintageCoder can check whether there is a new version and shows the changes with a link to the release page. It does not download or install anything itself. Nothing ever goes to the network without your consent.
setui-wo-vintagecoder-einstellungen-ablegt = Where VintageCoder stores its settings.
setui-woechentlich-beim-start = Weekly at start
